    "group": "Brood Brothers Auxilia",
    "summary": "A GENESTEALER CULTS army using this detachment may bring ASTRA MILITARUM allies. Their total allowance is 500 points for Incursion, 1,000 for Strike Force and 1,500 for Onslaught. Choose a GENESTEALER CULTS model as WARLORD. Any allied models with Voice of Command lose it. Allies cannot have these keywords: AIRCRAFT, OGRYN, EPIC HERO, RATLING, COMMISSAR, MINISTORUM PRIEST, MILITARUM TEMPESTUS or TECH-PRIEST ENGINSEER.",
